 rced local proteins and then cooked over live fire\, ensuring fresh\, bol
 d flavours in every bite. An expertly curated menu of refreshing libation
 s and craft beverages are offered to complement the chefs dishes. Tickets
  for this boutique-style event are limited\, and only sold in advance.
