DESCRIPTION:The Peruvian Film Festival Toronto returns for its second edi
 tion from July 27 to August 2\, 2026\, celebrating the best of contempora
 ry Peruvian cinema during Peru’s Independence season.\n\nHosted at Imagin
 e Cinemas Carlton\, the festival will showcase a curated selection of awa
 rd-winning feature films\, Canadian premieres\, restored classics\, filmm
 aker Q&As\, special guests\, and cultural events. All films will be prese
 nted with English subtitles\, making them accessible to all audiences.\n\
 nGet your Free tickets here: www.eventbrite.com/cc/peruvian-film-festival
 -toronto-2026-4843728 https://www.eventbrite.com/cc/peruvian-film-festiva
