SUMMARY: Tech A Jump: An Immersive Carnival Experience
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate carnival inside a state-of-the-art 360-degree immer
 sive entertainment environment!\n\n\nTech A Jump – Carnival Weekend\n\n\n
 \nShowtimes:\n\nThursday July 30th\, 5:30pm and 7:30pm\n\nFriday July 31s
 t\, 5:30pm and 7:30pm\n\n\nStep inside Tech A Jump\, an immersive live pe
 rformance experience during Toronto Carnival Weekend.\n\nTech A Jump brin
 gs together immersive technology\, live music\, dance\, comedy\, storytel
 ling\, and Carnival energy to take you on a one-of-a-kind audience journe
 y. This is not a traditional stage show\, nor is it a passive immersive e
 xhibit. Tech A Jump is a hosted\, interactive experience that invites you
  into the spirit\, rhythm\, humour\, and movement of Carnival through a b
 old fusion of art\, culture\, and creative technology.\n\nGuided by a liv
 e host\, audiences will move through a vibrant world inspired by Carnival
  tradition and Caribbean celebration. Along the way\, you will encounter 
 live performers\, musicians\, dancers\, and unexpected moments of comedy 
 and connection\, all set inside a visually immersive environment designed
  to surround you in sound\, light\, movement\, and energy.\n\nTech A Jump
  celebrates the feeling of Carnival before the road: the anticipation\, t
 he music\, the characters\, the jokes\, the costumes\, the rhythm\, the r
 elease\, and the joy of gathering together. It is a love letter to the cu
 lture\, but with a futuristic twist.\n\nWhether you are a Carnival vetera
 n\, a soca lover\, a lover of live performance\, or someone looking for s
 omething completely different during Carnival Weekend\, this experience i
 s designed to pull you in from the moment you arrive.\n\nWhat to expect:\
 n\n  * A full live immersive show experience\n  * A hosted audience journ
 ey led by a comedic host\n  * Live music and Carnival-inspired performanc
 e\n  * Dancers\, musicians\, and surprise moments throughout\n  * Immersi
 ve visuals\, sound\, and creative technology\n  * A celebration of Carniv
 al culture in a unique venue environment\n\nThis is your chance to experi
 ence Carnival through a new lens: part theatre\, part celebration\, part 
 technology-driven spectacle\, and fully alive with the energy of the week
 end.\n\nCome ready to move\, laugh\, listen\, participate\, and take in s
 omething you have not seen before.\n\nFour performances only. Limited tic
 kets available.\n\nDon’t miss Tech A Jump during Toronto Carnival Weekend
 .\n\n\nShowtimes:\n\n  * Thursday July 30th - 5:30pm and 7:30pm\n  * Frid
 ay July 31st - 5:30pm and 7:30pm
CATEGORIES:Dance---Performance---Theatre,Art-Show/Gallery-Event,Illuminar
 ium
