SUMMARY: CARIBANA BACCHANAL 2026
DESCRIPTION:🎉 CARIBANA BACCHANAL 2026 🎉\n\nToronto\, get ready for an u
 nforgettable night of Caribbean vibes! Join us at The Parkdale Drink on S
 aturday\, August 1st from 10PM–2AM for Caribana Bacchanal 2026. Expect no
 n-stop energy with the hottest Soca\, Dancehall\, Reggae\, Afrobeats\, Re
 tro & 90's anthems\, an open patio\, and an atmosphere built for pure car
 nival celebration.\n\nMusic provided by Di Arsonist (@diarsonist) & BLACK
  HEART iNiVERSAL (@theiniversal)\, keeping the dance floor bubbling all n
 ight long.\n\n🎟️ $15 Advance (Eventbrite)| $20 at the Door\n📍 The Parkd
 ale Drink – 1292 Queen St. W.\, Toronto\n\nCome dressed to impress\, brin
 g your family & friends\, and experience the bacchanal! 🇯🇲🇹🇹🇧🇧🇬🇾?
