SUMMARY: BLOOD SUGAR 6ix MAGIK
DESCRIPTION:Saturday August 8th\, the Linsmore Tavern (1298 Danforth Ave)
  is excited to welcome a top notch Tribute act ready to perform in their 
 local neighbourhood! BLOOD SUGAR 6IX MAGIK The Red Hot Chili Peppers Trib
 ute Band is hitting the stage again after blowing us away with 2 previous
  SOLD-OUT shows over the past year at the Linsmore! Some of the members o
 f this band have been performing the music of RHCP for more than 20 years
 ! This is going to be a really fun evening of music that you will want to
  check out and MUST-SEE show for RHCP fans. Tickets are $12 in advance\, 
 $15 at the door.\n\nBLOOD SUGAR 6IX MAGIK is a Red Hot Chili Peppers trib
 ute band formed right at the end of the lockdown when four fans started t
 o jam at the docs.\n\nFounded by Andrea (vocals) and Tyson (drums)\, the 
 band is completed by Noel (bass) and Brendan (guitar\, backing vocals) an
 d driven by the unparalleled mix of raw energy and melodic vibes of the C
 alifornian kings of funk rock.\n\nThe meticulous search for the original 
 sounds\, style and instruments has been a journey started with Andrea bac
 k 2004 in Europe with his two tribute bands highly regarded by the local 
 RHCP fans\, and continued in Toronto with the best Chili’s inspired perfo
 rmers in town.\n\nPRESALE TICKETS https://www.linsmoretavern.com/tc-event
 s/34241/
CATEGORIES:Concert,Linsmore-Tavern
