SUMMARY: Artists in Performance: Ukrainian Art Song Summer Institute
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a delightful afternoon of Ukrainian Art Songs fea
 turing the participants from the 2026 Ukrainian Art Song Summer Institute
  held at The Royal Conservatory of Music.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity t
 o hear eight extraordinary emerging artists as they interpret the works o
 f Ukrainian composers including Vasyl Barvinsky\, Stanyslav Liudkevych\, 
 Mykola Lysenko\, Yakiv Stepovy\, Kyrylo Stetsenko\, Stefania Turkewich an
 d Myroslav Volynsky.\n\nFeatured artists:\nLeah Brooks (soprano)\, Julian
 a Hentosz (soprano)\, Sadie Karlsson (soprano)\, Quin Lang (piano)\, Tani
 a Mandzy Inala (mezzo-soprano)\, Carter Martin (tenor)\, Olivia Smart (so
 prano) and Andrew Whiteside (tenor)\nArtist-in-residence: Justyna Bluj (s
 oprano)\nGuest artist: Roman Borys (cello accompaniment)\nCollaborative p
 ianists: Steven Philcox and Leanne Regehr\n\nWe hope that this performanc
 e will move you to support the work of the Ukrainian Art Song Project as 
 we strive to preserve Ukrainian culture during these difficult times.\n\n
 For more information\, please visit www.ukrainianartsong.ca http://www.uk
 rainianartsong.ca/
CATEGORIES:Concert
