SUMMARY: The Art Bar Market\, Patio Pop Up
DESCRIPTION:📍Hey Toronto\,\n\nI'd love for you to swing by our cozy comm
 unity pop-up!\n\n🎨 THE ART BAR MARKET\n\nThe second installment of our p
 atio pop-up is bringing another creative Saturday to the heart of Lesliev
 ille. It’s small\, local\, relaxed and showcases good people making cool 
 things.\n\nWander the market\, meet local artisans\, discover handmade tr
 easures\, grab something to eat or drink\, and settle in for an afternoon
  on The Duke Art Bar patio.\n\n✨ Here’s what’s happening:\n\n🛍️ Handmade
  goods from local makers\n\n🍔 Food specials\n\n🍹 Summer drink specials\
 n\n🎨 Community Art Board: add your own little piece and help us create s
 omething together\n\n🖌️ Meet local artists and makers\n\n📸 Strike a pos
 e at our colourful photo-op wall\n\n🌿 Hang out\, have a drink and enjoy 
 the Queen East/Leslieville vibe\n\n🎨AND CALLING ALL ARTISTS!\n\nBring yo
 ur sketchbook\, canvas\, paints\, pencils\, whatever you’re working on an
 d pull up a chair. You’re welcome to create on-site alongside other creat
 ives.\n\nThe Art Bar Market may be small\, but it’s really about somethin
 g bigger:\n\nConnecting local with local.\n\nArtists meeting neighbours.\
 n\nNeighbours discovering makers.\n\nPeople creating together.\n\nAnd one
  historic Queen East patio gets a little more colourful along the way.\n\
 n🎁Come by the market\, tell us this post sent you\, and you’ll be entere
 d into our Local Love Giveaway! It’s a fun little thank-you for stopping 
 by and it helps us see how our creative community is finding us.\n\nShop.
  Create. Come hang out!\n\nSATURDAY AUGUST 22\n\n11-5PM\n\n1225 QUEEN STR
 EET EAST\, The DUKE PATIO\n\n🎨 Art • Community • Good Times!\n\n📩Inquir
 ies..Email: pourgirlartscreativestudio@gmail.com mailto:pourgirlartscreat
 ivestudio@gmail.com\n\n#ArtBarMarket #TheDukePatio #Leslieville #QueenEas
 t #LeslievilleToronto #TorontoArtists #TorontoMakers #HandmadeToronto #Sh
 opLocalToronto #SupportLocalArtists #TorontoMarkets #TorontoPatio #Creati
 veCommunity #EastEndToronto
CATEGORIES:craftmarket,leslieville,thedukelive,communityevent,Market,The-
 Duke
