UID:TKF/6755f42da02aaf1c2599e7ae/20782/29790870/0/0
DTSTART:20260823T023000Z
DTEND:20260823T080000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/torevent/detail/20782/1787452200000
SUMMARY: Sonic Sancocho - Edición La Canícula
DESCRIPTION:A parranda for La Canícula - the dog days of summer… we’re br
 inging the best tropical energy to celebrate the season.\n\nJoin us at Dr
 om Taberna with performances by Soukustek and a hybrid PA performance / D
 J set by local\, Colombian-Canadian gem\, David Ariza.\n\nOur headlining 
 band\, Soukustek https://www.instagram.com/soukustek/ - comprised of Tury
  Morey and Claro Torres - gives us a taste of life growing up in Cartagen
 a\, Colombia\, surrounded by African influences and Caribbean culture. Th
 eir vibrant\, energetic performances paint bright portraits of heritage\,
  enriched by movement and rhythm. The group's name combines Soukous (a po
 pular Congolese dance music genre) and Champetex (a nod to Champeta\, the
  Afro-Colombian musical culture deeply rooted in the Atlantic coast).\n\n
 You know we always bring out the OGs… for this edition\, we are thrilled 
 to welcome David Ariza https://www.instagram.com/innerpeaceouterspace/ \,
  who will deliver a signature soundscape between Soukoustek’s sets. David
  Ariza is a Juno Award winning Colombian electronic artist\, DJ\, and pro
 ducer based in Toronto. His sets blend deep house\, techno\, and Latin rh
 ythms into immersive journeys that move between raw energy and cinematic 
 storytelling.\n\nAs always\, Founders\, Juana Go-gó https://instagram.com
 /gogojuana and olasconola https://instagram.com/olasconola will share a b
 old blend of music to welcome you to the party.\n\nComplimentary cup of S
 ancocho at midnight for ticket holders - please note: first come\, first 
 served.\n\nWhat is Sancocho? Learn more about the history here https://en
 .wikipedia.org/wiki/Sancocho .\n\nAdvance Eventbrite ticket holders must 
 check in to the venue by 11 pm.\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 22\, 2026\nDoo
 rs: 10:30 pm\nMusic: 11:00 pm - 4:00 am\nLocation: DROM Taberna - 458 Que
 en Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada\n\nAbout Sonic Sancocho:The spice 
 of life in sound\, shared with community. Much like ingredients in a univ
 ersal dish - a big pot of soup - here\, platters of sound are spun and se
 rved with warm welcome. Musical ingredients from around the world\, from 
 a local perspective\, for all to share and enjoy. Founded by selectresses
  olasconola http://instagram.com/olasconola & http://instagram.com/gogoju
 ana Juana Go-gó https://instagram.com/gogojuana in Toronto\, Canada\, Son
 ic Sancocho is a community gathering of music and food - two things that 
 nourish heart and soul. They bring forth the B Sides and the beloved of L
 atin music\, with sounds from around the world\, to your venue through al
 l-vinyl DJ sets and dynamic live performances. Sancocho is where all of t
 he ingredients come together and are shared amongst one another - from th
 e starches to the spices and everything in between. We turn up the heat t
 o bring it to a boil\, coming together to enjoy a moment of connection th
 rough a serving of soup\, within layers of sound\, endless movement and f
 un.\n\nTune in to the radio show https://ciut.fm/sonicsancocho/ \, hosted
  & produced by Juana Go-gó https://instagram.com/gogojuana - Sundays at 2
 :00 pm ET on CIUT 89.5 FM!
CATEGORIES:Concert,DROM-Taberna,DJ/Club/Rave
