SUMMARY: Summer Series at Casa Loma: Tribute Shows
DESCRIPTION:A summer-long escape is unfolding at Toronto’s most iconic ca
 stle. From June 8th to September 7\, Casa Loma https://casaloma.ca/ invit
 es guests to experience its 10th annual Summer Series\, featuring a rotat
 ing lineup of live music nights throughout its gardens and historic groun
 ds.\n\nEach weeknight brings a different musical experience beneath the s
 tars:\n\n  * Mondays: Symphony in the Gardens - an elegant evening of orc
 hestral performances set against the castle’s illuminated terraces.\n  * 
 Tuesdays: Rock Symphony - blending classical instrumentation with iconic 
 rock anthems for a powerful crossover experience.\n  * Wednesdays: Tribut
 e Shows - celebrating legendary artists through live performances that br
 ing familiar hits to life in a uniquely atmospheric setting.\n\nIn additi
 on to the music\, guests are invited to explore the grounds and enjoy the
  food and beverage offerings throughout the evening as the castle transfo
 rms into an open-air concert destination.
CATEGORIES:Concert,Casa-Loma
