SUMMARY: Dressing the Abbey Costume Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:Step into the world of Downton Abbey™ at Casa Loma with Dress
 ing the Abbey\, a special exhibition showcasing original costumes worn by
  the stars of the beloved television drama.\n\nFeaturing award-winning de
 signs created by London costume house Cosprop Ltd.\, the exhibition highl
 ights the elegance and evolution of British aristocratic fashion from the
  late Edwardian era through the 1920s. Guests can view everything from re
 fined country tweeds and servants’ uniforms to lavish evening gowns adorn
 ed with intricate embroidery\, lace\, and beading.\n\nBuilt in 1914\, Cas
 a Loma provides a fitting backdrop for the exhibition\, with its grand Ed
 wardian architecture and historic interiors offering an immersive setting
  that echoes the world of Downton Abbey™.\n\nThe exhibit is also included
  with a daytime GA ticket to Casa Loma.
CATEGORIES:Casa-Loma
