SUMMARY: Walk for Suicide Awareness 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Distress Centres of Greater Toronto https://www.dcogt.com
 / (DCGT) returns for its annual Walk for Suicide Awareness https://www.dc
 ogt.com/events/ on Sunday\, September 13. Hosted during Suicide Awareness
  Month\, the Walk brings the community together to honour those lost\, ch
 allenge the stigma around suicide and fund life-saving support services.\
 n\nThe Walk will follow a scenic path of just under 4.5 km along the shor
 es of Lake Ontario. Participants are encouraged to donate or lead fundrai
 sing efforts\, with all proceeds supporting DCGT’s free\, confidential\, 
 24/7 emotional support\, crisis intervention\, suicide prevention and sur
 vivor support services.\n\nParticipants will receive a t-shirt and an Hon
 our Bead necklace as a meaningful way to recognize personal connections t
 o the cause and remember loved ones lost to suicide.\n\nSnacks and refres
 hments will be served following the Walk.\n\nRegister https://raceroster.
 com/events/2026/115184/walk-for-suicide-awareness-2026 for the Walk for S
 uicide Awareness today and join us as we walk toward hope\, healing\, and
  a stronger\, more connected community.
CATEGORIES:
